<title>PHILIPPINES: Bacnotan Consoldated sets 25 centavos dividend.</title>
<headline>Bacnotan Consoldated sets 25 centavos dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bacnotan Consolidated Industries said on Thursday it was paying a 25 centavo cash dividend to shareholders on record as of July 30.</p>
<p>The dividend will be paid on August 20.</p>
<p>The announcement made in a statement to the Philippine Stock Exchange did not say for what period the dividend was being paid.</p>
<p>Bacnotan Consolidated is a holding firm with interests in several cement companies.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8934</p>
